      "content": "okay okay i hear you but look... the pain is actually starting to calm down a little bit now that i'm sitting still. it's more of a dull ache now than the tearing feeling. i really don't want to make a big deal out of nothing if it's just indigestion. if i take a couple of these antacids and maybe some ibuprofen to help with the inflammation, do you think that'll settle it down so i can just finish my shift? i'll keep an eye on it, i promise.",
