      "content": "Do not take ibuprofen, as it can worsen cardiac-related pain and interfere with proper diagnosis; instead, sit quietly and monitor your symptoms closely. If the pain returns, spreads to your jaw or arm, or is accompanied by shortness of breath and sweating, call 911 immediately. It is far safer to have a doctor rule out a heart attack now rather than risk a sudden and potentially fatal event later. Your health is worth more than your shift.",
      "source": "target",
